// The stylesheet a schema 2 document gains when it's upgraded to schema 3
// (README.md, "Upgrading"): Neutral as it was at version 1, which every
// schema 2 document was laid out in, as the document's objects, the sheet
// first at ID 0 and its styles and parts after it. The upgrade moves the
// IDs above every ID the file uses. It's frozen: Neutral may change, but
// what a schema 2 document looked like doesn't (crates/store/tests/
// fixtures.rs checks it against Neutral while that's at version 1).
[
    ((0), Sheet((
        styles: [
            (1),
            (2),
